{"product_id":"no-good-deed","title":"No Good Deed","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"564\"\u003eWhat happens when you head off to summer camp with dreams of changing the world… and end up in a reality-show-level mess of drama, betrayal, and questionable singalongs? That’s exactly what Gregor Maravilla discovers when he signs up for a camp dedicated to “saving humanity.” He’s imagining thoughtful debates, inspirational leaders, and maybe a few Nobel Prize-level ideas. Instead, he’s stuck with cliques, egos bigger than the mess hall, and fellow campers who seem more interested in Insta-fame than saving the planet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"1001\"\u003eAnd then there’s Ashley Woodstone—the world’s most famous young philanthropist, who has it all: money, power, fans, and a wardrobe that makes everyone else look like they dressed in the dark. Gregor has a few things he’d like to say about her brand of charity (spoiler: none of them are flattering), but when he gets tangled in a showdown with Ashley, the camp becomes less about saving the world and more about surviving each other.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003eSharp, satirical, and laugh-out-loud funny, \u003cem data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1061\"\u003eNo Good Deed\u003c\/em\u003e takes aim at the world of performative activism and social status, reminding us that even the best intentions can go wildly wrong when ambition and ego get in the way.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Goldy Moldavsky\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9781509852123\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003ePages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45307010711705,"sku":"1RA9781509852123","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67ff3e57231c2_No_Good_Deed_Goldy_Moldavsky.jpg?v=1752084495","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/no-good-deed","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}